%% WiFi Test Orchestrator architecture baseline 0.1.0
sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Server
    participant N as FCM or APNs
    participant M as Mobile agent

    S->>N: Send notification without task or secret
    N-->>M: Best-effort notice
    Note over N,M: Notice may be delayed, duplicated or lost
    M->>M: Evaluate OS lifecycle and permitted execution
    M->>S: Retrieve task by outbound HTTPS
    S-->>M: Current task or no available work
    M->>M: Validate foreground, permission and interaction conditions
    M->>S: Execute, defer or report reason through HTTPS
